    rdf:value """ her  sons, in default of Don Guido’s heirs - but Donna Camilla has a mind that can never rise above base sordidness. Even her adoration for her sister, which fills her whole existence, manifests itself chiefly by boring all her acquaintances to make a réclame for Donna Laura. Volgarississimo!!
Yesterday I saw that romantic Villa Bisuschio. B.B. has had to keep quiet, owing to a dreadful cold, caught the day we drove to Arzate to see the romanesque Baptistery - a real gem of architecture.
Last night the Italian Ambassador to Russia dined here, Prince Pio di Savoia. He had the air of a man profoundly bored with life, and they """^^xsd:string ;
